      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 9 St. Patrick’s Place, Enniscorthy is a delightful three bedroomed mid-terrace property, extended to the rear located in a terrific town location most convenient to all local amenities. Situated in a most desirable mature residential location, this property is brimming with such features as solid fuel stove with back boiler central heating, cast iron surround open fireplace full remodelled kitchen extension with fully fitted kitchen, bathroom fully tiled, well laid out accommodation, fully floored throughout , upvc double glazed windows  and small yard to rear. \r\n\r\nAccommodation \r\nAccommodation is laid out to consist of entrance hall, ground floor bedroom /study, opening to sitting room with cast iron surround open fireplace and timber staircase to first floor,  opening up to large kitchen with fitted presses, hot press, plumbed for washing machine, gas cooker, oven, tiled floor & part tiled walls, large solid fuel stove connected to radiators.  The bathroom offers wc, whb, bath and walk-in shower cubicle with electric shower, tiled to floor & all wet areas. On the first floor both bedrooms are laid with laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nTo the rear is a low maintenance walled in rear garden it benefits from back access.  \r\nIdeal town central property would suit a wide range of purchasers to include first time buyers, downsizers and would also make an astute investment.\r\nSuch excellent townhouses in excellent locations such as this are selling very quickly at the moment. Do not miss your opportunity, call Paula Treacy Estates today to arrange a viewing today.\r\n\r\nSize \r\n 70 square metres approx. \r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains water, sewage and electricity. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIncluded \r\nGas cooker, washing machine, undercounter fridge. \r\n\r\n\r\nDirections \r\nY21X7P9\r\nFrom Pettitt’s Super Valu proceed straight past taking the first left, proceed to t junction St Patricks place is located to the right hand side, private cul-de-sac."
      },
      {
